&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSLod2R2NEzMRaAeSDeDJqBulZKk5WlbXyib8wI7w4SVA&oe=6B046474"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 2.png", "id": "1339585267486548", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821099_1339585270819881_5752003200383625231_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nZj40FFvfx4Q7kNvwGZi5j_&_nc_oc=AdreWuItiGgs10aNqgE2Mg2LZUaqr4ZCJfB2y7uXlfC_qE_KI8d6U3vb-Pn2U4cFpkE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQKdfgZFbpFgAiO9jz3XxPyIZqJaL0_vaauNFoXwsz3Mg&oe=6B04590D"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 4.png", "id": "25299459349722807", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_25299459369722805_1875565800982623569_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZfJWx8T14BUQ7kNvwGR2EdR&_nc_oc=AdqVboNHAxLOIrbbR3vbB3yTfPXEtW57YoQYhpAWkyVwOFiGItFHUmgU-ceoiYjxdV0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTx8KuFiJQoucCh54i0bF0DZdMqQ53w3ApT6HkOJM3hdQ&oe=6B04658F"}, {"file_name": "Trailer 5.png", "id": "2038404890292862", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819859_2038404893626195_50283950361106217_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lZGG66tziwoQ7kNvwEOJaMa&_nc_oc=Adq4fiU7ycKGtfmlROhFFf94KoA0bd2NycOxsjukj37VEZ-hw8vJ6t5ekSw-QwsMUzM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTE16t_159cEdhcnMvKnov9jM04CMz1P3zN9vV17q9EIA&oe=6B045D77"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer poster.png", "id": "1340193764070608", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819239_1340193767403941_2787865297931591383_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7xB6wj3Ka4kQ7kNvwEKtbHG&_nc_oc=AdoeOEEhVWF_cQWTm2YsExN3sNZHtu1p7S4uJikQqXFscY1BJzvSJvFtV-xYBz0aFbs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTm2eiyzMF2S7vpWLcfxBcRDPSeptF4-My6jydq8acrhA&oe=6B047458"}, "display_name": "Plank n' Kitty", "keywords": [], "long_description": "## Plank n' Kitty\n\nGran\u2019s cat has wandered off and ended up at the end of a plank high above the city!\n\nStep through the doorway into a virtual cartoon world, walk the plank, rescue the kitty, and bring it safely back to gran.\n\n**Plank \u2019n Kitty is a mixed-reality experience, not a game.**  \nIt\u2019s designed to be fun, approachable, and best enjoyed with friends or family taking turns.  \nEveryone can join in by watching the action on TV or mobile.\n\n---\n\n## What makes it different\n\n- **Two-way mixed-reality portal**  \n  A door in your room opens into a virtual world \u2014 and from the plank, the door becomes a portal back into your real room.\n\n- **Exciting but not extreme**  \n  High enough to feel thrilling, without pushing into fear-only territory. Accessible fun for everybody.\n\n- **Configurable play space**  \n  Preview and adjust the size and position to fit your room before you start.\n\n- **Perfect for group play**  \n  Take turns, watch reactions, and enjoy it together.\n\n- **TV casting support**  \n  Cast to a TV so everyone can see what the player sees.\n\n---\n\n## Device Support\nSupports mixed reality on Quest 2, Quest 3, and Quest Pro.  \nPassthrough quality varies by device.\n\n---\n\n## Comfort Note\nThis experience involves real-world movement.  \nThis is a **room-scale mixed reality experience** and adapts to your available space.  \nMake sure your area is clear before playing.", "short_description": "Gran\u2019s cat has gone missing. Step through the portal, walk the plank high above the city, and bring the kitty home. A fun, approachable mixed-reality experience made for friends, families, and party play."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.rayamedia.com/home/plank-n-kitty-privacy-policy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Rayamedia", "s